_df[xcol], scatter_df[ycol])\n","plt.xlabel(xcol)\n","plt.ylabel(ycol)\n","plt.title(\"Scatterplot: Avg_Credit_Limit vs Total_Credit_Cards\")\n","plt.grid(alpha=0.3)\n","plt.show()\n","\n","# Korelasi & linear regression (cek linearitas)\n","corr = scatter_df[xcol].corr(scatter_df[ycol])\n","lr = LinearRegression()\n","lr.fit(scatter_df[[xcol]], scatter_df[ycol])\n","r2 = lr.score(scatter_df[[xcol]], scatter_df[ycol])\n","\n","print(\"Pearson Correlation:\", corr)\n","print(\"R²:\", r2)\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":522},"id":"nNLEQGlGL25h","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1758825806876,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":240,"user":{"displayName":"febriansyah adi n","userId":"10867581229344160713"}},"outputId":"45a13853-bfd9-4c98-b674-d22832ebfcf4"},"execution_count":34,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 700x500 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Pearson Correlation: 0.6088604935524963\n","R²: 0.37071110060898904\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Dari scatterplot Avg_Credit_Limit vs Total_Credit_Cards, titik-titik terlihat agak menyebar tetapi cenderung naik — artinya ada hubungan positif.\n","\n","Nilai korelasi Pearson = 0.61 → termasuk korelasi sedang.\n","\n","Nilai R² ≈ 0.37 → artinya hanya sekitar 37% variasi pada jumlah kartu kredit yang bisa dijelaskan oleh rata-rata limit kredit.\n","\n","sebaran data tidak benar-benar linier sempurna, tetapi ada kecenderungan hubungan linear positif dengan kekuatan sedang."],"metadata":{"id":"NRWyoL0xMSlq"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["2. Buatlah model klasterisasi dengan menggunakan model K-Means. Tentukan jumlah k yang terbaik dengan menggunakan elbow method. Lengkapi analisis Anda dengan linechart dan hasil analisis mengapa Anda memilih nilai tersebut."],"metadata":{"id":"Jf5LG3H5MYoY"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n","from sklearn.cluster import KMeans\n","from sklearn.metrics import silhouette_score\n","import numpy as np\n","\n","X = scatter_df[[xcol, ycol]].values\n","X_s = StandardScaler().fit_transform(X)\n","\n","inertias, sil_scores = [], []\n","ks = range(1,11)\n","\n","for k in ks:\n","    km = KMeans(n_clusters=k, random_state=42, n_init=10)\n","    km.fit(X_s)\n","    inertias.append(km.inertia_)\n","    if k > 1:\n","        sil_scores.append(silhouette_score(X_s, km.labels_))\n","    else:\n","        sil_scores.append(np.nan)\n","\n","# Elbow plot\n","plt.plot(ks, inertias, marker='o')\n","plt.xlabel(\"Jumlah cluster (k)\")\n","plt.ylabel(\"Inertia (WCSS)\")\n","plt.title(\"Elbow Method KMeans\")\n","plt.show()\n","\n","# Silhouette plot\n","plt.plot(ks, sil_scores, marker='o')\n","plt.xlabel(\"Jumlah cluster (k)\")\n","plt.ylabel(\"Silhouette Score\")\n","plt.title(\"Silhouette Score vs k\")\n","plt.show()\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":927},"id":"APb4H8H1Mdz3","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1758825951173,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":965,"user":{"displayName":"febriansyah adi n","userId":"10867581229344160713"}},"outputId":"3e1c87ef-4050-4f1a-d7c6-7b88f59a1156"},"execution_count":36,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Elbow Method (WCSS/Inertia): Grafik inertia turun tajam dari k=1 sampai k≈3, setelah itu penurunannya melandai. Ini menunjukkan titik “siku/elbow” ada di sekitar k = 3.\n","\n","Silhouette Score: Nilai silhouette tertinggi juga ada di k=3, yang artinya pemisahan cluster paling baik terjadi saat jumlah cluster 3.\n","\n","Pada k < 3, cluster terlalu sedikit sehingga data yang berbeda bisa digabung secara paksa.\n","\n","Pada k > 3, inertia memang berkurang tetapi penurunannya kecil (tidak efisien).\n","\n","k=3 menghasilkan keseimbangan antara kompak (inertia rendah) dan terpisah jelas (silhouette tinggi)."],"metadata":{"id":"Z6_OTzsCNWk_"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["3. Gambarkan hasil klasterisasi dengan model K-Means dengan menggunakan scatterplot."],"metadata":{"id":"fK78IhNqNchP"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["best_k = np.nanargmax(sil_scores) + 1  # pilih k terbaik berdasarkan silhouette\n","\n","km_final = KMeans(n_clusters=best_k, random_state=42, n_init=10)\n","labels = km_final.fit_predict(X_s)\n","\n","plt.scatter(scatter_df[xcol], scatter_df[ycol], c=labels)\n","plt.xlabel(xcol)\n","plt.ylabel(ycol)\n","plt.title(f\"KMeans Clusters (k={best_k})\")\n","plt.show()\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":472},"id":"tRNVjYI7NbZI","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1758826208991,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":162,"user":{"displayName":"febriansyah adi n","userId":"10867581229344160713"}},"outputId":"35001abf-199a-4f5d-e415-57d715092961"},"execution_count":37,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Scatterplot memperlihatkan data terbagi menjadi 3 kelompok utama.\n","\n","Cluster pertama berisi data dengan credit limit rendah & jumlah kartu sedikit.\n","\n","Cluster kedua berisi data dengan credit limit sedang & jumlah kartu menengah.\n","\n","Cluster ketiga berisi data dengan credit limit tinggi & jumlah kartu banyak."],"metadata":{"id":"IXg1m2yWNoje"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["4. Buatlah model klasterisasi dengan menggunakan DBSCAN dengan seluruh variabel yang dapat digunakan."],"metadata":{"id":"ASNHt9x2N1q_"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from sklearn.cluster import DBSCAN\n","from sklearn.neighbors import NearestNeighbors\n","\n","num_df = df.select_dtypes(include=[np.number])\n","num_df = num_df.loc[:, num_df.nunique()>1].dropna()\n","\n","X_all = StandardScaler().fit_transform(num_df)\n","\n","# k-distance plot\n","min_samples = 5\n","nbrs = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=min_samples).fit(X_all)\n","distances, indices = nbrs.kneighbors(X_all)\n","k_distances = np.sort(distances[:, -1])\n","\n","plt.plot(range(1, len(k_distances)+1), k_distances)\n","plt.xlabel(\"Points\")\n","plt.ylabel(\"Distance ke tetangga ke-5\")\n","plt.title(\"k-distance plot (DBSCAN eps estimation)\")\n","plt.show()\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":472},"id":"-erMcHRgN1PG","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1758826358094,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":281,"user":{"displayName":"febriansyah adi n","userId":"10867581229344160713"}},"outputId":"e2ff6408-4208-402b-c3b9-0ba53c14b1e4"},"execution_count":38,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Lihat grafik k-distance plot.\n","\n","Cari titik siku (perubahan slope tajam → dari datar jadi curam).\n","\n","Ambil nilai eps ≈ jarak pada titik tersebut."],"metadata":{"id":"sG6lXtj9OHFu"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["5. Tentukan jumlah k yang terbaik dengan menggunakan elbow method. Lengkapi analisis Anda dengan linechart dan hasil analisis mengapa Anda memilih nilai tersebut."],"metadata":{"id":"5TE2M963N2D4"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","from sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\n","from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n","from sklearn.cluster import KMeans\n","from sklearn.metrics import silhouette_score\n","\n","numeric = df.select_dtypes(include=[np.number]).copy()\n","X_num = SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\").fit_transform(numeric)\n","X_scaled = StandardScaler().fit_transform(X_num)\n","\n","inertias = []\n","Ks = range(1,11)\n","for k in Ks:\n","    km = KMeans(n_clusters=k, random_state=42, n_init=10).fit(X_scaled)\n","    inertias.append(km.inertia_)\n","\n","plt.figure(figsize=(8,4)); plt.plot(list(Ks), inertias, marker='o'); plt.xticks(list(Ks))\n","plt.xlabel(\"k\"); plt.ylabel(\"Inertia\"); plt.title(\"Elbow Method (semua variabel numerik)\"); plt.grid(True); plt.show()\n","\n","sil = []\n","Ks2 = range(2,11)\n","for k in Ks2:\n","    labels = KMeans(n_clusters=k, random_state=42, n_init=10).fit_predict(X_scaled)\n","    sil.append(silhouette_score(X_scaled, labels))\n","\n","plt.figure(figsize=(8,4)); plt.plot(list(Ks2), sil, marker='o')\n","plt.xlabel(\"k\"); plt.ylabel(\"Silhouette Score\"); plt.title(\"Silhouette (semua variabel numerik)\"); plt.grid(True); plt.show()\n","\n","print(\"Silhouette scores (k=2..10):\", dict(zip(Ks2, np.round(sil,4))))\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":840},"id":"XFIGqvOHN2cg","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1758827066736,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":974,"user":{"displayName":"febriansyah adi n","userId":"10867581229344160713"}},"outputId":"cbe1e789-5fba-45eb-e556-de5a11ac2e7c"},"execution_count":51,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 800x400 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 800x400 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Silhouette scores (k=2..10): {2: np.float64(0.3751), 3: np.float64(0.4439), 4: np.float64(0.3235), 5: np.float64(0.2666), 6: np.float64(0.2453), 7: np.float64(0.2416), 8: np.float64(0.2295), 9: np.float64(0.2108), 10: np.float64(0.2204)}\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Elbow Method (Inertia) → memberi indikasi berapa cluster cukup (lihat titik siku).\n","\n","Silhouette Score → validasi tambahan, memilih k yang memberi kualitas cluster terbaik.\n","\n","Analisis akhir → pilih k di mana:\n","\n","Ada “siku” jelas di grafik inertia.\n","\n","Nilai silhouette relatif tinggi."],"metadata":{"id":"jhbwN_uROHc9"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["6. Tentukan nilai silhouette score dan DBI dari model DBSCAN."],"metadata":{"id":"sTzMpPR5N8BW"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","from sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\n","from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n","from sklearn.cluster import DBSCAN\n","from sklearn.metrics import silhouette_score, davies_bouldin_score\n","\n","df = pd.read_csv(\"CC_Customer_Dataset.csv\")\n","numeric = df.select_dtypes(include=[np.number]).copy()\n","X_num = SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\").fit_transform(numeric)\n","X_scaled = StandardScaler().fit_transform(X_num)\n","\n","db = DBSCAN(eps=0.8, min_samples=5).fit(X_scaled)\n","labels = db.labels_\n","\n","cluster_labels = [lab for lab in set(labels) if lab != -1]\n","if len(cluster_labels) >= 2:\n","\n","    mask = labels != -1\n","    sil = silhouette_score(X_scaled[mask], labels[mask])\n","    dbi = davies_bouldin_score(X_scaled[mask], labels[mask])\n","    print(f\"Silhouette (DBSCAN, excluding noise) = {sil:.4f}\")\n","    print(f\"Davies-Bouldin Index (DBSCAN, excluding noise) = {dbi:.4f}\")\n","else:\n","    print(\"DBSCAN menghasilkan kurang dari 2 cluster (setelah mengecualikan noise). Silhouette/DBI tidak dapat dihitung.\")\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"YbetQ73AN9s_","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1758827284678,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":44,"user":{"displayName":"febriansyah adi n","userId":"10867581229344160713"}},"outputId":"7871fc46-5ab5-4911-a57d-1a8d30565ca0"},"execution_count":53,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Silhouette (DBSCAN, excluding noise) = 0.1089\n","Davies-Bouldin Index (DBSCAN, excluding noise) = 1.1872\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Kode ini dipakai untuk mengevaluasi hasil clustering DBSCAN:\n","\n","Silhouette Score → seberapa jelas cluster terbentuk.\n","\n","DBI → seberapa baik cluster terpisah.\n","\n","Hanya dihitung jika DBSCAN menemukan ≥2 cluster valid."],"metadata":{"id":"N5NdbTiYOHtD"}}],"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[{"file_id":"/v2/external/notebooks/intro.ipynb","timestamp":1758680591264}]},"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","name":"python3"}},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0}